---
title: "Health Promotion and Assessment"
code: "NSG-200"
category: "nursing"
credits: "3"
prerequisites:
  - "2026/BIO-141"
  - "2026/ENG-111"
  - "2026/ITE-119"
  - "2026/PSY-230"
  - "2026/SDV-101"
  - "2026/NUR-135"
  - "2026/HLT-143"
corequisites:
  - "2026/BIO-142"
prerequisiteNote: "Prerequisites: Acceptance to Nursing Program, BIO 141, ENG 111, ITE 119, PSY 230, SDV 101, NUR 135, HLT 143"
